{"hymn":"S541","parent":"E673","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"De Ti acepto mi porción","subtitle":"Consuelo en las pruebas—Por la voluntad del Señor","syl":{"n1":"De","n2":"Ti","n3":["a","i"],"n4":["cep","m"],"n5":["to","t"],"n6":"mi","n7":["por","i"],"n8":["ción,","t"],"n9":"Y","n10":["en","i"],"n11":["ten","m"],"n12":["der","t"],"n13":"no","n14":["bus","i"],"n15":["co","t"],"n16":"hoy;","n17":"Pues","n18":["cie","i"],"n19":["go","t"],"n20":"soy,","n21":"mas","n22":"Tú","n23":"sí","n24":"ves,","n25":"Tu","n26":["vo","i"],"n27":["lun","m"],"n28":["tad","t"],"n29":["a","i"],"n30":["cep","m"],"n31":["ta","m"],"n32":["ré.","t"],"n33":"Tu","n34":["vo","i"],"n35":["lun","m"],"n36":["tad","t"],"n37":["a","i"],"n38":["cep","m"],"n39":["to","t"],"n40":"yo","n41":["Cual","i"],"n42":["quie","m"],"n43":["ra","t"],"n44":["se","i"],"n45":["a,","t"],"n46":"sin","n47":["te","i"],"n48":["mor;","t"],"n49":"Pues","n50":"me","n51":["sos","i"],"n52":["tie","m"],"n53":["ne","t"],"n54":"Tu","n55":["a","i"],"n56":["mor,","t"],"n57":"Tu","n58":["vo","i"],"n59":["lun","m"],"n60":["tad","t"],"n61":["a","i"],"n62":["cep","m"],"n63":["to","t"],"n64":"yo."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Cuando no pueda ver Tu faz,","Cuando me abrume el pesar,","En Tu Calvario pensaré,","Tu voluntad aceptaré."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Cuando de gozo gusto yo,","Te doy las gracias, mi Señor;","Mi copa, Tú la llenas bien,","Tu voluntad aceptaré."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Enfrento todo con Tu paz,","De Ti lo acepto sin dudar;","Pues todo obra para bien,","Tu voluntad aceptaré."]}]}